    "## 4. Node features\n",
    "\n",
    "### Region features\n",
    "`data['region'].x` includes standardized region centroid coordinates, taxi activity counts, destination counts, and aggregated POI category counts. Exact column names are in `feature_names['region_feature_names']`.\n",
    "\n",
    "### POI features\n",
    "`data['poi'].x` contains semantic multi-hot OSM tag features from categories such as `amenity`, `shop`, `tourism`, and `public_transport`.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Road features\n",
    "`data['road'].x` currently contains standardized log road length.\n"
   ]
  },
