   "source": [
    "## 5. Supervised examples\n",
    "\n",
    "Supervised examples are stored as shards such as:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "supervised_shards/train/train_000.pt\n",
    "supervised_shards/val/val_000.pt\n",
    "supervised_shards/test/test_000.pt\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Each shard is a Python list of example dictionaries. Each example is a lightweight prefix-to-destination sample. It does not store the full future GPS trajectory.\n",
    "\n",
    "Typical fields:\n",
    "\n",
    "```text\n",
    "trip_id, timestamp, prefix_sample_id, prefix_len_points, full_len_points\n",
    "prefix_region_seq_raw, prefix_region_seq\n",
    "dest_region_raw, dest_region\n",
    "dest_lon, dest_lat, dest_x, dest_y, dest_offset_x, dest_offset_y\n",
    "call_type, origin_call, origin_stand, taxi_id, day_type\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "Training interpretation: input is `prefix_region_seq` plus optional metadata; label is `dest_region`, optionally with `dest_offset_x` and `dest_offset_y`.\n"
   ]
  },
