      "Demo dataset size: 200000\n",
      "{'prefix_region_seq': tensor([2184]), 'dest_region': tensor(2302), 'dest_offset': tensor([-82.6335,   6.8405]), 'meta': {'timestamp': 1372636853, 'call_type': 'C', 'origin_call': None, 'origin_stand': None, 'taxi_id': 20000380, 'day_type': 'A'}, 'trip_id': 1372636853620000380}\n"
